.TH claim 1  "claim " 
.SH NAME
claim \- Claim an item: mark it in progress (and optionally assign it)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBclaim\fR [\fB\-\-assignee\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIID\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Claim an item: mark it in progress (and optionally assign it)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-assignee\fR \fI<ASSIGNEE>\fR
Assignee to record
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIID\fR>
Item id
